# Dlib face-landmark model (Face Avatar System, Phase 2) — a ~95MB binary
# not worth committing. Fetch it with:
#   curl -L -o Assets/FaceAvatar/models/shape_predictor_68_face_landmarks.dat.bz2 http://dlib.net/files/shape_predictor_68_face_landmarks.dat.bz2
#   bzip2 -d Assets/FaceAvatar/models/shape_predictor_68_face_landmarks.dat.bz2
Assets/FaceAvatar/models/*.dat
